{
  "info": {
    "name": "SIGECIN API (JWT + Refresh Token)",
    "description": "API REST de SIGECIN protegida con JWT.\n\n1. Ejecuta **Autenticación → Login como cliente** (o como negocio). El script guarda `accessToken` y `refreshToken` en las variables de la colección.\n2. Todas las peticiones heredan `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}` de la colección.\n3. El JWT de acceso dura 15 minutos. Cuando una petición responda 401, ejecuta **Autenticación → Renovar tokens (refresh)**: rota el refresh token y emite otro JWT.\n4. **Cerrar sesión** revoca el refresh token; después de eso el refresh responde 401.\n\nRequiere la aplicación corriendo en `{{baseUrl}}` (por defecto http://localhost:8080).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "businessId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "serviceId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "date",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "startTime",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "appointmentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "reasonId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login como cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"carlos.ramirez@unam.mx\",\n  \"password\": \"pass1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Devuelve el JWT de acceso y el refresh token, y los guarda en la colección."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "// En la ventana de gracia la respuesta no trae refreshToken: se conserva el anterior",
                  "if (body.refreshToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login como negocio",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"barberia.estilo@unam.mx\",\n  \"password\": \"pass5678\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Dueño de la Barbería El Estilo (rol BUSINESS)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "// En la ventana de gracia la respuesta no trae refreshToken: se conserva el anterior",
                  "if (body.refreshToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Usuario actual (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Datos del JWT enviado en Authorization. Sin token o con token vencido responde 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Renovar tokens (refresh)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Rota el refresh token: el enviado queda revocado y se recibe uno nuevo. Reutilizar un token rotado (pasada la ventana de gracia de 30 s) revoca toda la sesión."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "// En la ventana de gracia la respuesta no trae refreshToken: se conserva el anterior",
                  "if (body.refreshToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cerrar sesión (logout)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Revoca el refresh token. El JWT de acceso sigue siendo válido hasta que vence."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Catálogo público (sin token)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Buscar negocios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/businesses?name=barber&page=0&size=12",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "businesses"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "barber"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "12"
                }
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle de negocio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/businesses/{{businessId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "businesses",
                "{{businessId}}"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Disponibilidad",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/businesses/{{businessId}}/availability?serviceId={{serviceId}}&date={{date}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "businesses",
                "{{businessId}}",
                "availability"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "serviceId",
                  "value": "{{serviceId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "{{date}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Horas libres del servicio en la fecha. Guarda la primera en `startTime` para reservar."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Si no se fijó una fecha, usa el próximo lunes (la Barbería abre de lunes a sábado)",
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('date')) {",
                  "  const d = new Date();",
                  "  d.setDate(d.getDate() + ((8 - d.getDay()) % 7 || 7));",
                  "  const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('date', `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${pad(d.getDate())}`);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.slots.length) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('startTime', body.date + 'T' + body.slots[0]);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Cliente (login como cliente)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Reservar cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/client/appointments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "appointments"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"serviceId\": {{serviceId}},\n  \"startTime\": \"{{startTime}}\",\n  \"clientNotes\": \"Reserva desde Postman\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Ejecuta antes **Disponibilidad** para llenar `startTime`. Un horario ocupado responde 422."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('appointmentId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis citas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/client/appointments?page=0",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "appointments"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "0"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtros opcionales: status (PENDING, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED), from y to (AAAA-MM-DD)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle de mi cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/client/appointments/{{appointmentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "appointments",
                "{{appointmentId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Motivos de cancelación (cliente)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/client/cancellation-reasons",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "cancellation-reasons"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('reasonId', pm.response.json()[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelar mi cita",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/client/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "client",
                "appointments",
                "{{appointmentId}}",
                "cancel"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reasonId\": {{reasonId}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
